Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:09.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,My mommy always said there were no monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:11.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,No real ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.83,0:04:16.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,But there are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:19.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've seen no additional defects.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.34,0:04:26.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- She's perfect.   - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:54.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:57.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two centimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:05:02.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:04.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:06.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ready with that amnio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:13.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh.   - And...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:20.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.61,0:05:25.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.16,0:05:36.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:45.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:50.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Clamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:56.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,What about her? Can we keep her alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.31,0:05:58.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,How's the host?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.31,0:06:00.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:07.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sew her back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:13.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excellent work, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:57.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,And how is our Number 8 today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.93,0:08:00.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Appears to be in good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:03.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hmm? How good?   - Excellent,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:07.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,as in completely off our projected charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:10.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at the scar tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.95,0:08:17.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- See the recession?   - This is from three days ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:21.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Exactly.   - Oh, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:23.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:28.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're gonna make us all very proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.89,0:08:46.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:48.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't. I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:51.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:01.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hand.   - Close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.58,0:09:03.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Glove.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:15.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Number 8?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.63,0:09:17.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.64,0:09:20.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Good. Cherries.   - It's unprecedented.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.81,0:09:23.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Totally. She's operating...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:26.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,at a completely adult capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:31.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What about her memories?   - There are gaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.69,0:09:34.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And some degree ofsynaptic dissonance.   - You know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.99,0:09:36.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- She's freaked.   - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:38.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,It has connective difficulties,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:41.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,caused by a biochemical imbalance, causing emotional autism.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:43.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Certain reactions   - All right, wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:47.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,It has memories. Why does it have memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:50.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm guessing, but... inherited memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.21,0:09:53.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,passed down generationally at a genetic level...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:55.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,by the aliens, like its strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:10:00.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Plus a, uh, highly evolved form of instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:03.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,An unexpected benefit from the genetic crossing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.68,0:10:06.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, ho, ho, ho, ho. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:08.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stupid me. Ofcourse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:11.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,An unexpected benefit ofthe genetic process.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:14.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! And I didn't even think ofthat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:18.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's try this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:23.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:27.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:30.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.59,0:10:35.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley? Ripley?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:42.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not thinking termination?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:44.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, am I thinking termination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.11,0:10:47.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,General, we do not perceive this to be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.11,0:10:49.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ellen Ripley died trying to wipe this species out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.90,0:10:52.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,For all intents and purposes, she succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:54.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not anxious to see her taking up her old hobbies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.87,0:10:57.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That won't happen.   - We won't tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.41,0:11:00.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. And that's supposed to comfort me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:04.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Identification, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.63,0:11:10.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.63,0:11:12.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, General Perez.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.05,0:11:16.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bottom line is, she looks at me funny one time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.39,0:11:18.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm putting her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.39,0:11:20.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, as far as I'm concerned, Number 8...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.77,0:11:24.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,is a meat... by-product.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.57,0:11:30.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Her Majesty here is the real payoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.57,0:11:32.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- When does she start producing?   - Days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.95,0:11:34.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Less maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.91,0:11:39.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We need the cargo.   - I told you, it's on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.62,0:12:19.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fork.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:24.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Fuck.   - It's-It's "fork."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:30.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,How did you-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.63,0:12:34.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,How did... we get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:36.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:43.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hard work. We used blood samples...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.81,0:12:45.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,from Fiori Sixteen on ice,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:48.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,where you died.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.31,0:12:51.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've remade you. We cloned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.25,0:12:54.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fiori Sixteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:12:58.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Does that ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:13:01.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you remembering something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:06.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Does it grow?   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.19,0:13:09.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Very rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.19,0:13:11.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:16.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,How did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.32,0:13:19.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,She'll breed. You'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:23.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the company will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.49,0:13:25.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,In the-In the-In the company?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:29.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Weyland-Yutani. Ripley 8's former employers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.87,0:13:33.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Terran growth conglomerate. They had...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.13,0:13:35.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,defense contracts under the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:38.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, they went under decades ago, Gediman. Way before your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.01,0:13:40.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bought out by Wal-Mart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.93,0:13:45.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fortunes ofwar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.31,0:13:48.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thinkyou will find that, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:52.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,things have changed a great deal since your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:54.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.65,0:13:56.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're not flying blind here, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.65,0:14:00.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's United Systems Military, not some greedy corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:04.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, it won't make any difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.79,0:14:08.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're still gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.92,0:14:12.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,How do you feel about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:20.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wish you could understand what we're trying to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.51,0:14:24.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,The potential for this species goes way beyond urban pacification.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.35,0:14:26.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,New alloys, new vaccines.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:29.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing like this we've ever seen on any world before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:31.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,You should be very proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:35.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.73,0:14:38.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,And the animal itself-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:40.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,wondrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:44.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,The potential, unbelievable, once we've tamed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:49.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Roll over. Play dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:51.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heel? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.54,0:14:54.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't teach it tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:58.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why not? We're teaching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.35,0:15:17.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, son, I'll give you my authorization code.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:21.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's E-A-T-M-E.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.49,0:15:23.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir. Could you repeat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.82,0:15:25.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Little prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:27.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:30.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,no matter how many times you see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:34.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,the sight ofa woman all strapped up in a chair like thatjust-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:38.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:41.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just bring us in on a 3-0 descent, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.13,0:15:44.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And ride the parallel.   - Darlin', it is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.26,0:15:46.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:49.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,You, uh, want anything there, trigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:53.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Yeah. How 'bout a cup ofcoffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:55.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anything else, while your mouth's warm, I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:58.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Little milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.19,0:16:03.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't cut thrust till about 600 meters,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.28,0:16:05.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,and we'll give 'em a little scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Vriess. Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:09.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lock down. We're gonna dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:36.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Call?   - Yep?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.98,0:16:41.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,What has two thumbs, one eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.82,0:16:44.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,a pink tongue...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:48.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,and screws like a god?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:51.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:02.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two thumbs, one eye, a pink tongue...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:06.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,and screws like a god?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.38,0:17:09.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.82,0:17:28.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Time to enjoy some of the general's hospitality, Christie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.53,0:17:31.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great. Army food.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.74,0:17:35.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It'll do till we get the family wagon up to spec, I reckon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.75,0:17:39.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That is ifthe natives are friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:42.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:44.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:46.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,We expecting any, uh, trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:50.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nah. From Perez, I doubt it. But you never know. We've been there before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.78,0:18:08.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.82,0:18:10.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just a little target practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.16,0:18:14.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Vriess isn't complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:17.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.87,0:18:21.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johner, you son ofa bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.08,0:18:24.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, man. You didn't feel a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:31.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are an inbred motherfucker, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:39.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll take the knife back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:48.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.07,0:18:52.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's been sucking down too much home brew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.28,0:18:55.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,The knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:01.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Son ofa bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.50,0:19:07.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't push me, little Call. You hang with us for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.09,0:19:09.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,you'll find out I am not the man with whom to fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.77,0:19:23.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's about time we start associating with a better class of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.86,0:20:12.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.03,0:20:15.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the U.S.M. Auriga.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.03,0:20:19.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Step forward for contraband and weapons search.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.78,0:20:22.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please report any infectious diseases...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.87,0:20:24.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,to the medical officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.87,0:20:28.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Levels 7 through 12 are off-limits to civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:31.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you foryour cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:33.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.72,0:20:38.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get your hands up, please, sir.   - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.97,0:20:41.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Could you get your hands up, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.23,0:20:53.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,There are no weapons allowed on board, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.28,0:20:57.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,My own recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:21:00.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Way more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.75,0:21:08.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice welcome, Perez. What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.08,0:21:11.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,What, are you afraid the six of us are gonna hijack your damn ship or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:15.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just a minor concern that one ofyour asshole crew members...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:17.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,is gonna get drunk and put a bullet through the hull.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.97,0:21:20.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,We happen to be in space, Elgyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:22.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No shit.   - How you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.02,0:21:33.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wanna check the chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.03,0:21:42.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Elgyn, these were very, very hard to come by.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.53,0:21:44.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,So was our cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:49.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're, uh, not about to plead poverty on me, are you, General?   - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:52.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just saying very few people deal in cash nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.46,0:21:55.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just the ones don't like to keep business records.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.17,0:21:57.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yourself, for example.   - Drink, Elgyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:21:59.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Constantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.26,0:22:07.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm gonna take a wild guess here, General,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.14,0:22:10.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I'm thinking whatever you got going on here,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:14.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,it, uh, ain't exactly approved by Congress.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.07,0:22:18.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's the...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.49,0:22:21.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,new fillyyou got on board, Elgyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.20,0:22:25.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call. Little girl playing pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:27.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,She makes an impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.91,0:22:31.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,She is severely fuckable, ain't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.67,0:22:42.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mighty handy with a monkey wrench too, I might add.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:46.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think Vriess has got a bit ofa light in his eye for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:49.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fine little ass like that'd make a man walk. You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:57.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mind you, uh, I think she'sjust a tad curious...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.53,0:23:00.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,about, uh, this little transaction ofours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.32,0:23:02.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, I can't say as I blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.32,0:23:04.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's awfully cloak-and-dagger stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.82,0:23:07.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a military operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.45,0:23:10.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Really?   - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.62,0:23:13.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Correct me if I'm wrong, but, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.62,0:23:15.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was under the impression that, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.84,0:23:20.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,most army medical labs don't have to operate outside of regulated space.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:23.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What do you want, Elgyn? What can I do foryou?   - Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.72,0:23:27.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.   - Oh, two days bed and board.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.22,0:23:30.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, Vriess might wanna snag a part here or there, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.35,0:23:32.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, uh, if it's not imposing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.39,0:23:34.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't see any problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.27,0:23:37.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Couple ofconditions though. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.27,0:23:38.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Conditions?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.24,0:23:43.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.49,0:23:45.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,nor any ofyour...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.49,0:23:47.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,formidable crew members...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.74,0:23:49.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,will go anywhere near...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.70,0:23:52.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,restricted areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.08,0:23:54.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rule number two:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.88,0:23:57.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,No trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.96,0:24:00.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Good behavior.   - Good behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.42,0:24:05.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No fights.   - No fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.51,0:24:10.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mi casa es su casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.46,0:24:39.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please direct cargo to med lab center, area "G."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.96,0:24:43.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Follow the lit path.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.38,0:24:45.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do not deviate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.73,0:24:59.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cargo status: stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.36,0:25:02.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Life-forms intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.15,0:25:04.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stasis uninterrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.08,0:25:21.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Med lab center is off-limits to civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.79,0:25:23.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.32,0:26:36.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh.   - Hey. Chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.95,0:26:40.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, please.   - You know I can't lay offthe tall ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.33,0:26:43.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Howyou doin'? How about a little one-on-one?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.67,0:26:45.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.43,0:26:53.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got some moves on you, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.43,0:26:55.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.48,0:27:06.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.87,0:27:21.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, now, ifyou don't wanna play basketball, I know some other indoor sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.22,0:27:36.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, now. Give me the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.65,0:27:50.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got a new game.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.57,0:27:51.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tag!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.67,0:28:09.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley? Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.01,0:28:17.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've had enough fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.60,0:28:24.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.61,0:28:36.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Something ofa predator, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.70,0:28:40.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, she continues to make us all very proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.90,0:29:59.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're coming up on just one minute and 30 seconds left...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.74,0:30:01.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,to order this one-of-a-kind collector's item.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.74,0:30:05.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ,Johner, what do you put in this shit, battery acid?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.70,0:30:08.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just for color.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.00,0:32:19.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, we're a fast learner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.67,0:32:22.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now here's a fine item. This is a really good show, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.92,0:32:25.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's from the Gut Cutter's Celebration Collection,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.80,0:32:28.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,makers of premier knives and edge ware.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.85,0:32:31.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,The knife features a stainless steel blade,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.77,0:32:35.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,perfect for any use in hunting or in the home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.19,0:32:39.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,The pro handle is made from authentic antique plywood...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.19,0:32:41.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,and stained in brilliant colors for an uncanny charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.86,0:32:45.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, that shit is not easy to come by!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.53,0:32:47.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a walk outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.78,0:32:50.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,...to a cutting edge that will rip through anything-
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.98,0:32:54.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.45,0:32:56.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm so sorry.   - Now I smell like this shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.08,0:32:59.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,If bitches can't handle this shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.08,0:33:01.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,bitches should stay away from this shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.09,0:33:03.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go to bed. Fucking bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.57,0:33:29.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Identification, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.37,0:33:42.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.75,0:33:48.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, General Perez.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.67,0:34:25.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.26,0:34:30.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,You gonna kill me, orwhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.93,0:34:34.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's no point, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.93,0:34:37.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,They've taken it out ofyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.47,0:34:40.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where is it? Is it on the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.35,0:34:44.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,You mean my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.44,0:34:48.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. Ifthey took it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.82,0:34:51.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,why are they keeping you alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.53,0:34:55.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, they're curious. I'm the latest thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.00,0:35:06.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.46,0:35:08.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can make it all stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.46,0:35:12.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,The pain, this nightmare. That's all I can offeryou.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.48,0:35:22.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,What makes you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.64,0:35:24.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I would let you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.86,0:35:30.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.86,0:35:34.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley, Ellen, Lieutenant First Class,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.03,0:35:37.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,number 36706.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.08,0:35:42.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ellen Ripley died 200 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.08,0:35:46.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.54,0:35:49.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.43,0:35:58.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.43,0:36:02.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a thing, a construct. They grew you in a fucking lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.56,0:36:05.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,And now they brought it out ofyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.90,0:36:08.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not all the way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.07,0:36:19.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can feel it... behind my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.70,0:36:22.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can hear it moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.08,0:36:30.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,You gotta help me stop this thing before it gets loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.88,0:36:35.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.88,0:36:38.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.43,0:36:40.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.60,0:36:45.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not as long as I'm around.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.81,0:36:49.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll never get out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.15,0:36:52.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.86,0:36:54.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.49,0:37:00.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can make it stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.12,0:37:09.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go on. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.46,0:37:11.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're looking foryou.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.43,0:37:27.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think you're gonna find that this was very ill-advised.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.14,0:37:29.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where are her friends?   - They're in the mess hall, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.77,0:37:32.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, you find them, now. Quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.02,0:37:34.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.86,0:37:37.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Smells like a double-cross, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.91,0:37:41.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's the other one? With the chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.33,0:37:44.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't ever touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.41,0:37:45.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.62,0:37:48.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,You wanna tell us what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.21,0:37:50.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You wanna tell me who you're workin' for.   - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.29,0:37:53.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wren, they got nothing to do with this.   - To do with what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.50,0:37:56.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you know what the penalties for terrorist activity are?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.51,0:38:00.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,No goddamn terrorists on my crew. Call, there something you wanna tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.43,0:38:04.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look. I don't care whether you knew or not. You brought a terrorist on board a military vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.39,0:38:07.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,And as far as I am concerned, you all die with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.27,0:38:11.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.19,0:38:16.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.53,0:38:18.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.66,0:38:22.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Christie.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.12,0:38:27.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.71,0:38:31.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.18,0:38:42.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop! Drop your weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.59,0:38:46.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you! Drop that piece ofshit, or I blow his head off!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.51,0:38:48.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can't do that, man.   - Drop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.02,0:38:51.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can't do that. They're attached to me.   - I'm not fucking with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.69,0:38:54.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're all under arrest for a code eight, which is concealed weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.94,0:38:57.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,and a code 12, which is murder!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.15,0:38:59.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Release Dr. Wren!   - Kiss my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.15,0:39:01.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Put down yourweapons and assume the fucking-
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.53,0:39:08.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.36,0:39:12.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Real easy, soldier boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.96,0:39:15.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Security.   - Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.50,0:39:19.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,There is a serious problem in the mess hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.17,0:39:21.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,You lie to me now, little girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.93,0:39:26.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will cut your throat and leave you here to die, you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.93,0:39:30.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This is security, Section 2. We do not read you.   - Hello? Goddamn it! Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.48,0:39:32.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,We do not copy you. Please repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.60,0:39:34.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hello?   - Please repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.74,0:41:10.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gediman!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.78,0:41:14.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's conducting illegal experiments. He is breeding some sort of-
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.50,0:41:18.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ice the goddamn mole!   - Listen to me! He is breeding an alien species.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.71,0:41:20.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,More than dangerous. Ifthose things get loose,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.75,0:41:23.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,it's gonna make the Lacerta plague look like a fucking square dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.55,0:41:26.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.01,0:41:28.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.01,0:41:32.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your attention, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.56,0:41:36.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Security breach, med lab, Level 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.95,0:42:34.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go. Let's get back to the Betty. Doctor and soldier boy here can see us to the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.49,0:42:36.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What about Vriess?   - Fuck Vriess.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.96,0:42:49.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your attention, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.05,0:42:53.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unauthorized opening ofcage three.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.43,0:42:57.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unauthorized opening ofcages five,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.22,0:43:00.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,seven, eight, 10-
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.48,0:43:02.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Move it! Now!   - Evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.85,0:43:05.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Go! Go now!   - Evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.95,0:43:18.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.75,0:43:30.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Evacuation.   - Move it! Go! Get on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.34,0:43:33.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your attention, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.30,0:43:34.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nonhuman presence detected,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.01,0:43:38.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Levels 21, 23,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.85,0:43:42.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,27, 14,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.02,0:43:47.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Level 38, Level 39.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.82,0:43:50.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.57,0:43:53.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Proceed to lifeboats.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.70,0:43:55.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.82,0:43:57.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.23,0:45:08.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll give you holes, you slimy bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.03,0:45:14.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Move it! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.36,0:45:16.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Final lifeboat ready for launch.   - Get aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.54,0:45:24.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.54,0:45:27.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Complete evacuation now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.17,0:45:37.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Grenade.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.85,0:46:34.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alert. Alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.19,0:46:36.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Evacuation incomplete.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.32,0:46:41.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Civilian presence detected in area "H." Warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.70,0:46:45.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Main vessel declared uninhabitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.25,0:46:55.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Elgyn, come on. Let's move, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.25,0:46:57.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.00,0:48:20.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Elgyn? Elgyn, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.56,0:48:31.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Elgyn, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.10,0:48:37.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Elgyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.64,0:49:16.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Elgyn!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.73,0:49:19.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- God. Elgyn?   - Elgyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.86,0:49:22.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Elgyn!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.36,0:49:25.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Elgyn!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.15,0:49:27.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Easy, Hillard! Christie, give me a hand here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.86,0:49:29.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get him up!   - Give me a hand here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.57,0:49:33.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on! Let's get him up!   - Move out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.16,0:49:35.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No!   - Ah, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.16,0:49:37.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What the fuck did this?   - What's in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.05,0:49:46.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Call, get down!   - What the fuck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.34,0:49:48.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot! It's in front ofthe hull!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.35,0:49:52.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.93,0:49:56.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on, man. Time to go. Time to go!   - Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.64,0:49:59.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.60,0:50:02.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call, time to go! Come on, Call!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.90,0:50:06.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get the goddamn door open!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.57,0:50:10.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can't open it! We can't open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.24,0:50:18.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We gotta go back!   - I'm not going back! You go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.52,0:50:47.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.90,0:50:49.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Was it everything you hoped for?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.36,0:50:54.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.67,0:51:06.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do we do now, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.46,0:51:10.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Same thing we're doin'. Get the hell outta here!   - What if there's more?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.09,0:51:15.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,I say we stay here, man. Let the army guys deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.72,0:51:17.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where the fuck are the army guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.89,0:51:20.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.31,0:51:22.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, then we don't need this asshole anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.35,0:51:24.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Step back!   - No, you step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.36,0:51:26.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Stop it!   - You got no authority here!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.82,0:51:32.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Doctor, that thing that killed my partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.66,0:51:36.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- that's your pet science project?   - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.24,0:51:39.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let me do him right now, man!   - I should let him do you right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.66,0:51:42.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,How many more are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.33,0:51:45.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How many more are there?   - Twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.67,0:51:52.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Twelve?   - Twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.39,0:51:56.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.72,0:51:58.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,There'll be more.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.39,0:52:02.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.20,0:52:05.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,who do I have to fuck to get off this boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.00,0:52:11.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can get you off. Maybe not the boat, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.13,0:52:16.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let's get out of here.   - No, wait a second here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.30,0:52:18.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,She was the host for these monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.38,0:52:20.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wren cloned her because she had one inside her.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.88,0:52:23.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.51,0:52:27.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,She was part of his experiment, and she will turn on us in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.60,0:52:29.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't give a shit what she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.60,0:52:32.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's too much ofa risk. We have to leave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.40,0:52:35.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- She comes.   - We can't trust her!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.82,0:52:37.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.53,0:52:44.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,If we're gonna survive this mess, we all stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.74,0:52:46.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Agreed?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.67,0:53:01.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hillard, we gotta go. It's not over. We gotta get to the Betty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.91,0:53:33.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Make a nice souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.34,0:53:43.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.01,0:53:46.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Did what?   - Killed one of'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.51,0:53:49.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's like killing your own kind.   - It was in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.33,0:54:15.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.38,0:54:22.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who were you expecting, Santa Claus?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.42,0:54:25.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thought you were toast for certain, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.43,0:54:28.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit. Where's Elgyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.72,0:54:33.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.73,0:54:36.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, what if we get to the Betty and they're all over it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.44,0:54:39.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,All the activity's been in the aft sector by the barracks. Why would they move?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.06,0:54:39.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,They won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.94,0:54:41.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ifthey send anyone out,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.94,0:54:44.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,it'll be, uh, here,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.36,0:54:47.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,where the meat is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.61,0:54:51.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Well, I say ifwe wanna make any decent time, I say we ditch the cripple.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.75,0:54:57.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No offense, man.   - None taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.42,0:55:00.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody is left behind. Not even you,Johner.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.75,0:55:05.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's the quickest way out of here?   - After the cooling tower,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.59,0:55:07.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,there's a freight elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.26,0:55:10.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,It runs from the top ofthe ship down to Engineering Level 1 deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.76,0:55:14.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Take us straight to the dock.   - Sounds reasonable. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.27,0:55:17.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.77,0:55:20.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What?   -  The ship is moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.86,0:55:22.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.65,0:55:26.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,The ship has stealth run. There's no wayyou can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.20,0:55:29.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.24,0:55:32.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,The ship's been go since the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.12,0:55:35.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's a standard emergency procedure.   - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.20,0:55:38.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Any serious problem, and the ship autopilots back to home base.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.71,0:55:40.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you were planning on letting us know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.04,0:55:42.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.88,0:55:46.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's home base?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.72,0:55:49.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.68,0:55:52.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.14,0:55:55.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Bastard.   - Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.10,0:55:57.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd rather stay here with the things, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.14,0:55:59.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,How long until we get to Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.44,0:56:01.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Three hours almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.23,0:56:03.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,We gotta blow the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.44,0:56:06.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call, you're not blowing this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.28,0:56:08.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not while we're on it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.74,0:56:12.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,We get out ofthis shit, you do as you please, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.24,0:56:17.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Earth, man. What a shit-hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.92,0:56:27.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.05,0:56:36.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.81,0:56:43.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,I heard you, like, ran into these things before.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.44,0:56:47.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's right.   - Wow, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.94,0:56:51.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, like, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.20,0:56:56.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,I died.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.48,0:57:24.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.94,0:57:30.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.53,0:57:39.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.96,0:57:45.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley, we got no time for sightseeing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.26,0:57:52.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.38,0:59:57.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kill... me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.27,1:00:10.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.87,1:01:53.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.88,1:02:04.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't do what?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.10,1:02:18.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.82,1:02:20.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fuckin' waste ofammo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.98,1:02:22.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.78,1:02:26.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Must be a chick thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.46,1:03:39.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming, or is this not the shit we brought with us?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.05,1:03:42.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's the same shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.56,1:03:46.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stinks in here, man. Let's keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.76,1:04:22.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get away from me! Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.64,1:04:24.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Drop the rod, man.   - Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.64,1:04:27.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Do it!   - Get away from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.22,1:04:31.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get away from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.15,1:04:35.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.36,1:04:38.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's happening here?   - Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.57,1:04:42.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's happening here is we're getting the fuck off this ghost ship, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.57,1:04:45.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ship? What ship?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.12,1:04:49.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.66,1:04:53.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was in cryo, right? On my way to Xarem, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.29,1:04:55.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Work crew for the nickel refinery, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.92,1:04:58.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wake up. I know I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.63,1:05:05.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God. Uh, I s-I saw-I saw horrible things.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.55,1:05:09.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, you're coming with us. It's too dangerous for you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.24,1:05:21.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Leave him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.74,1:05:24.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fuckyou. We're not leaving him here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.62,1:05:28.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's got one inside of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.58,1:05:30.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can smell it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.96,1:05:34.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Inside me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.04,1:05:39.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Inside me? What's inside me?   - Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.50,1:05:42.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want one ofthose things birthing anywhere near my ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.13,1:05:43.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a bad risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.84,1:05:48.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's inside me?   - Look, we can't just leave him here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.68,1:05:51.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I thought you came here to stop 'em from spreadin'.   - What's inside me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.14,1:05:54.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- There's gotta be a process. Can't you stop it?   - Got no time for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.35,1:05:57.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I can't do it here. The lab is out oforder.   - What's inside me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.11,1:05:59.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I could do him. Back ofthe head.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.36,1:06:01.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Painless. It might be the best way.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.82,1:06:04.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's inside me?   - No, there's got to be another way.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.45,1:06:07.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What ifwe freeze him?   - What's in-fuckin'-side me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.74,1:06:08.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,A parasite!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.29,1:06:13.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Foreign element.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.88,1:06:21.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a monster in your chest.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.46,1:06:25.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,These guys hijacked your ship,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.51,1:06:27.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,and they sold your cryo tube...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.55,1:06:30.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,to this... human,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.51,1:06:33.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,and he put an alien inside ofyou.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.93,1:06:35.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a really nasty one.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.90,1:06:40.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,And in a few hours, it's gonna burst its way through your rib cage...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.07,1:06:43.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,and you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.07,1:06:50.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.00,1:06:59.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.71,1:07:03.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm the monster's mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.34,1:07:09.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, he comes with us, we freeze him on the Betty,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.11,1:07:12.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,- then the doctor can remove it later.   - Fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.57,1:07:14.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Since when were you in goddamn charge?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.99,1:07:18.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Since you were born without balls!   - Ease off, people.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.54,1:07:31.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. You come with us. You might even live.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.46,1:07:34.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get twitchy on me, and you'll be shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.62,1:07:37.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's move out.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.47,1:07:51.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a mess down there! Is this the only way?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.55,1:07:54.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Vriess, we gotta lose the chair.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.77,1:07:58.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.81,1:08:00.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kawlang maneuver, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.02,1:08:04.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah,just like old times.   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.01,1:08:09.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Must be the cooling tanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.53,1:08:14.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Somebody must have opened the valves.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.20,1:08:16.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,The nasties couldn't have done this, could they?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.80,1:08:31.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're at the bottom ofthe ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.43,1:08:34.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to go through the kitchen, maybe 90 feet,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.64,1:08:37.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,to the freight elevator on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.64,1:08:41.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't like it.   - What's to like?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.31,1:08:44.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,This sucks!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.02,1:08:48.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wren, are you sure about the distance?   - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.03,1:08:52.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You ready to get wet, partner?   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.50,1:09:04.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, do your weapons fire underwater?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.04,1:09:09.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, they're disposables. They can take it.   - Disposables?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.43,1:09:15.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, I heard about those. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.51,1:09:20.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How many rounds?   - Twenty.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.02,1:09:24.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Split points give you a good hole, even at the smaller caliber.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.65,1:09:27.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh. Hey, that's cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.82,1:09:31.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. They're big with hitters 'cause you, uh, throw 'em away after thejob.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.36,1:09:34.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody likes to throw away a weapon they're attached to. You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.87,1:09:36.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.62,1:09:39.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guess I don't have to tell everyone to take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.88,1:09:47.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Christie, do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.89,1:09:50.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,When we hit the surface on the other side,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.89,1:09:53.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,no backstroke, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.92,1:13:27.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.95,1:13:42.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,They set a goddamn trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.00,1:13:44.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a goddamn ambush!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.98,1:14:51.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Distephano!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.25,1:15:15.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,It won't break. Give me yourweapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.76,1:15:19.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,You really are way too trusting.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.28,1:15:33.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.07,1:15:44.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,You killed her! You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.00,1:15:51.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll get you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.71,1:15:54.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Father, lock the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.85,1:16:13.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Christie! Climb! Climb!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.52,1:16:15.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm doin' it, man!   - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.15,1:16:17.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.48,1:16:20.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's jammed!   - Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.36,1:16:23.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's jammed
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.15,1:16:57.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get off my foot, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.66,1:17:07.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.37,1:17:12.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johner!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.29,1:17:14.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get off me! Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.50,1:17:18.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aaah!Johner!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.76,1:17:23.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Die, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.88,1:17:28.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do it, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.64,1:17:31.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.82,1:17:47.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Real nice party, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.31,1:18:19.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Christie! Christie!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.44,1:18:23.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Christie! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.40,1:18:27.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Christie!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.86,1:18:31.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.45,1:18:34.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't! We can make it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.83,1:18:37.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.75,1:18:42.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.47,1:19:32.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.27,1:19:37.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.81,1:19:44.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Baby, am I glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.52,1:19:47.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was sure that asshole got you. Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.53,1:19:49.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.78,1:19:53.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You got body armor on?   - Yeah. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.24,1:19:55.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,You took it in the chest. I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.85,1:20:19.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a robot?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.93,1:20:24.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Son ofa bitch! Our little Call isjust full ofsurprises.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.69,1:20:28.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,I should have known. No human being is that humane.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.90,1:20:31.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought synthetics were supposed to be all logical and shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.49,1:20:34.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're just a big old psycho, girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.16,1:20:37.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're a robot?   - You're a second gen, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.68,1:20:40.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're an Auton.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.02,1:20:45.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Robots designed by robots, right? Hah!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.35,1:20:47.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. That's right. I remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.48,1:20:50.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, they were supposed to revitalize the synthetic industry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.28,1:20:52.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Instead, they buried it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.28,1:20:55.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,They didn't like being told what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.95,1:20:58.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Government ordered a recall.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.28,1:21:00.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, I heard-I had-I had heard...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.62,1:21:03.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,that only a few-just a few-had gotten out intact.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.62,1:21:06.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Man, I never, never thought that I would see one!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.88,1:21:11.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great. She's a toaster oven.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.21,1:21:13.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can we leave now?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.61,1:21:17.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,How long before we land?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.18,1:21:20.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just under two hours.   - Hey, Vriess.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.22,1:21:22.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got a socket wrench? Maybe shejust needs an oil change.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.47,1:21:26.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry. Access denied.   - I can't believe I almost fucked it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.40,1:21:28.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like you never fucked a robot!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.27,1:21:31.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, ifWren gets in the computer, he could really screw us.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.86,1:21:34.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We gotta find a terminal.   - No, there's no console on this level.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.86,1:21:37.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We'd have to go back.   - Well, we can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.41,1:21:40.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And I don't know any ofWren's access codes.   - Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.08,1:21:44.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.79,1:21:46.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.96,1:21:49.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right. You're the new model droid.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.29,1:21:52.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You can access the mainframe by remote.   - No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.96,1:21:55.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,I burned my modem. We all did.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.55,1:21:59.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call, you can still patch in manually. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.34,1:22:03.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's ports in the chapel, up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.73,1:22:06.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.82,1:22:15.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're programmed for that?   - Don't make me do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.36,1:22:17.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't make me make you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.20,1:22:21.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.12,1:22:23.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's like my insides are liquid. It's not real.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.99,1:22:26.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get over it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.21,1:22:28.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can blow the ship before it reaches Earth...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.37,1:22:30.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,and kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.72,1:22:43.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just give us time to get out first.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.10,1:22:48.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Damn it.   - Anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.69,1:22:50.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.82,1:22:57.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Breach in Sector 7, Sector 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.11,1:23:01.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sector 9 unstable.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.24,1:23:05.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Engines operating at 41 %.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.16,1:23:08.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Eighty-six minutes until Earth dock.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.25,1:23:10.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,We burned too much energy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.71,1:23:14.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't make critical mass. I can't blow it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.09,1:23:16.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then crash it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.06,1:23:32.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm okay. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.36,1:23:36.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.44,1:23:38.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,I feel good.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.94,1:23:42.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ground level recalibrated.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.24,1:23:45.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,New destination: 7-6-0-4-0-3.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.83,1:23:48.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Uninhabited quadrant.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.37,1:23:51.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Braking systems off-lined. Acceleration increase.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.67,1:23:57.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Time until impact now 43 minutes, 8 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.80,1:24:01.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Try to clear us a path to the Betty...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.43,1:24:04.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,and start her up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.34,1:24:06.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.75,1:24:35.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.22,1:24:44.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Emergency override in console 45V, Level 1 .
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.47,1:24:51.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Wren. He's almost at the Betty.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.15,1:25:07.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Father, locate the power drain. Report.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.99,1:25:13.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Father? Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.50,1:25:21.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Father's dead, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.34,1:25:26.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Intruder on Level 1 .
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.34,1:25:30.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,All aliens, please proceed to Level 1 .
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.47,1:25:32.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got a mean streak.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.23,1:25:39.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Damn it.   - Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.94,1:25:42.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't touch me.   - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.90,1:25:46.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,You must think this is pretty funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.66,1:25:50.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm finding a lot of things funny lately,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.78,1:25:52.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I don't think they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.96,1:26:02.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why do you go on living?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.38,1:26:07.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,How can you stand being what you are?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.18,1:26:11.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not much choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.43,1:26:17.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,At least there's a part ofyou that's human.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.94,1:26:22.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm just   - Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.32,1:26:25.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.28,1:26:29.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.78,1:26:31.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,To kill you, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.95,1:26:34.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Before the recall,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.33,1:26:36.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I accessed the mainframe.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.33,1:26:40.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Every dirty little covert op the government ever dreamed of is in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.75,1:26:44.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,And this-you, the aliens,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.55,1:26:48.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,even the crew from the Betty-I knew ifthey succeeded, it would be the end ofthem.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.63,1:26:51.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why do you care what happens to them?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.85,1:26:54.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because I'm programmed to.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.77,1:26:57.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're programmed to be an asshole?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.85,1:27:02.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're the new asshole model they're putting out?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.15,1:27:03.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.78,1:27:08.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,I couldn't watch 'em do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.53,1:27:11.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I couldn't let 'em annihilate themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.70,1:27:13.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.54,1:27:19.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I did once.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.54,1:27:22.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I tried to save... people.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.29,1:27:25.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,It didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.05,1:27:28.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,There was this girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.88,1:27:32.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,She had bad dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.05,1:27:36.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I tried to help her.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.22,1:27:39.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,She died.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.35,1:27:42.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now I can't even remember her name.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.82,1:27:49.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.82,1:27:51.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.03,1:27:55.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you dream?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.12,1:27:59.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,I-Well, we have neuroprocessors that-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.75,1:28:03.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,When I sleep, I dream about them-it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.25,1:28:07.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Every night. All around me, in me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.63,1:28:10.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,I used to be afraid to dream, but I'm not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.05,1:28:13.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.72,1:28:15.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because no matter how bad the dreams get,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.80,1:28:17.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,when I wake up, it's always worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.40,1:28:25.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's not so far now!   - God, I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.73,1:28:27.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sleep when you die, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.24,1:28:41.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. This is bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.54,1:28:45.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I think we're near the nest.   - Well, then we'll go another way.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.54,1:28:48.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We don't have time.   - We got nearly 90 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.72,1:28:50.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Not anymore.   - What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.85,1:28:54.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What did you do, robot?   - Let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.89,1:28:59.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! You want to die here with your little brothers and sisters, that's cool!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.31,1:29:01.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I plan to live past today!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.82,1:29:04.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,If this little hunk of plastic is pulling any shit,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.40,1:29:06.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill her!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.45,1:29:10.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kill you! Does that compute?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.66,1:29:12.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or do I have to drawyou a schematic?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.87,1:29:15.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.00,1:29:21.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,You want another souvenir?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.01,1:29:30.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How far are the docks?   - A h-hundred yards.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.02,1:29:46.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.32,1:29:49.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.61,1:29:51.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley, we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.49,1:29:55.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hear them.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.58,1:29:58.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hear them. They're so close.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.37,1:30:00.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ripley.   - It's the queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.33,1:30:03.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's in pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.34,1:30:07.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.09,1:30:11.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.43,1:30:13.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.91,1:30:36.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.42,1:30:51.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,We gotta be moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.43,1:30:55.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,The best thing you can do is pray for a quick death.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.10,1:30:57.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.93,1:30:59.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.93,1:31:02.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been saying that all day.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.49,1:32:01.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's up to you now, Call.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.57,1:32:04.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need you to patch into the ship again and open the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.59,1:32:18.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johner, we should put Purvis in the freezer now.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.51,1:32:20.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, little buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.76,1:32:24.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nap time.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.94,1:32:33.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody moves, or I put a cap...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.15,1:32:35.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,right where this little droid's brain is.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.51,1:32:38.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Distephano, take the weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.39,1:32:40.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Begging your pardon, sir, but fuckyou!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.85,1:32:44.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, fine. Then I kill her, and you kill me,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.68,1:32:47.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,and we all die, and nobody goes home!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.77,1:32:50.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now drop the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.86,1:32:57.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then this little synthetic bitch...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.11,1:32:59.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,is gonna plug into the Auriga,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.53,1:33:01.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,and she is gonna take us right back to home base,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.91,1:33:04.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,according to the standard emergency procedures.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.45,1:33:07.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, she's not.   - Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.79,1:33:09.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,You still want to bring those things back to Earth?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.92,1:33:13.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Haven't you been paying any attention today?   - Ah, the intellectual speaks.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.30,1:33:16.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Stay there!   - Listen, ifyou don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.17,1:33:18.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever shut up?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.52,1:33:33.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why does nobody listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.73,1:34:19.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I told you. At first, everything was normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.82,1:34:22.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,The queen laid her eggs. But then she started to change.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.95,1:34:25.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,She added a second cycle cell.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.87,1:34:30.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.04,1:34:38.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,this time there is no host.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.51,1:34:41.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,There are no eggs.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.09,1:34:44.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,There is only herwomb...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.89,1:34:47.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,and the creature inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.77,1:34:50.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,That is Ripley's gift to her:
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.73,1:34:54.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,A human reproductive system.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.56,1:34:57.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,She is giving birth foryou, Ripley,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.94,1:35:01.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,and now she is perfect!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.41,1:36:30.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.83,1:36:33.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,a beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.84,1:36:36.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,beautiful butterfly.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.66,1:37:06.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.83,1:37:12.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.01,1:38:09.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah, look. Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.68,1:38:13.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Beautiful, beautiful little baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.60,1:38:18.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look. It thinks you're its mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.82,1:38:23.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.40,1:38:25.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.95,1:38:33.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.37,1:38:37.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.73,1:38:56.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Civilian vessel on line.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.10,1:38:58.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Emergency departure authorized.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.24,1:39:06.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. She's hot. I'll open the Auriga's air locks, pull the holding clamps on your mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.86,1:39:09.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right. I-I just need to find, uh, the, uh-
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.62,1:39:12.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,th-the vertical thrust lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.58,1:39:20.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you sure you guys can fly this thing?   - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.89,1:39:38.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Launch status is go.   - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.02,1:39:41.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.93,1:40:12.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey.   - I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.76,1:40:16.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get that a lot. Why are we still here?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.43,1:40:21.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm just, uh, finding the, uh, manual override.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.36,1:40:23.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- For Christ's sake.   - Hey, Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.44,1:40:25.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good memory. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.82,1:40:27.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ripley's back, man.   - Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.02,1:40:29.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.61,1:40:31.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't fly one of these things too, can you?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.87,1:40:34.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding? This piece ofshit is even older than I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.08,1:40:38.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it. We've still got breach. The hatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.62,1:40:42.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I closed it.   - Fixed the goddamn hatch a hundred times, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.25,1:40:44.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll get it. I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.65,1:41:08.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Approaching Earth's atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.57,1:41:12.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Window ofdeparture now 46 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.41,1:41:17.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call, we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.29,1:41:19.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.42,1:41:24.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.09,1:41:33.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Window ofdeparture now 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.31,1:41:40.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Grab on to something, Call. We're outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.84,1:41:57.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.23,1:42:12.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,This thing is gonna fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.69,1:42:16.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pressure's unstable!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.61,1:42:23.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go help Call turn on the auxiliary pump!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.98,1:42:52.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Distephano?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.00,1:43:16.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on! Step on it!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.75,1:43:19.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm not the mechanic here, Ironsides!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.55,1:43:21.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mostlyjust hurt people!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.51,1:43:24.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit. Call!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.18,1:43:28.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call, get back up here!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.14,1:43:32.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call! Call!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.64,1:43:37.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley! Hey, Ripley!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.11,1:43:44.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johner, where are you, you son ofa bitch?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.65,1:43:47.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get on it, bastard!   - What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.99,1:43:49.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Grab the sticks.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.63,1:44:05.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Put her down.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.06,1:45:45.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.08,1:46:07.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.13,1:46:09.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.30,1:46:14.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.31,1:46:20.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.83,1:46:48.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,U.S.M. Auriga will impact in five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.13,1:46:51.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Four. Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.34,1:46:53.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two. One.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.84,1:46:54.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.79,1:47:21.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's burnin'?   - Us!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.58,1:47:28.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit! You're right!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.29,1:48:49.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,So this is Earth, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.58,1:48:53.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.13,1:48:59.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is my first time here.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.47,1:49:07.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I suppose the military will be sniffing around here pretty soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.93,1:49:10.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bet you're not too anxious to see them.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.93,1:49:12.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.90,1:49:16.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, a person could get pretty lost around here ifthey wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.15,1:49:21.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.82,1:49:23.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.32,1:49:27.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.62,1:49:30.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a stranger here myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.40,0:01:47.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,《异形4：复活》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.65,0:03:34.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,(奥瑞戈军医研究太空船)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.55,0:03:40.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,(船舰组员: 军人42人 科学家7人)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:09.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我妈说世上没有怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:11.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,真正的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.83,0:04:16.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是真的有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:19.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们没见到多余的瑕疵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.34,0:04:26.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她很好  - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:54.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,当心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:57.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,2公分长
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:05:02.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:04.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:06.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备剪破羊膜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:13.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 噢  - 对了...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:20.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.61,0:05:25.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.16,0:05:36.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:45.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:50.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,夹住伤口
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:56.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,她怎样?可以留她活口吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.31,0:05:58.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,寄主状况如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.31,0:06:00.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,"寄主"很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:07.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,替她缝合伤口
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:13.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,做得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:57.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,8号今天如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.93,0:08:00.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,健康情况良好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:03.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 多好?  - 非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:07.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,胜于其他复制人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:10.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看她的疤痕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.95,0:08:17.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有凹陷吗?  - 3天前的伤口?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:21.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没错  - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:23.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:28.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你将让大家引以为荣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.89,0:08:46.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:48.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,不!我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:51.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,试试这个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:01.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 手  - 很接近
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.58,0:09:03.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,是手套
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:15.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,8号
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.63,0:09:17.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,水果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.64,0:09:20.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 很好,樱桃  - 史无前例的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.81,0:09:23.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,绝对是,她具有...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:26.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,成人的行为能力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:31.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她的记忆呢?  - 有些部份无法串连
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.69,0:09:34.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 某种程度的不协调  - 你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.99,0:09:36.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她很怪异  - 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:38.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,会有沟通障碍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:41.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,生物化学产生的情绪自闭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:43.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 某些反应...  - 且慢!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:47.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,她有记忆,她怎么会有记忆?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:50.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我猜是...遗传
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.21,0:09:53.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,如异形般代代遗传...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:55.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像她的力气
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:10:00.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,再加上高度进化的本能
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:03.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,配种基因的意外收获
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.68,0:10:06.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢!噢!噢!噢!噢!我明白了!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:08.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:11.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,配种基因的意外收获
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:14.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我居然没想到!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:18.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在试试这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:23.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:27.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:30.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.59,0:10:35.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉?蕾普莉?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:42.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是想除掉她吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:44.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我当然想!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.11,0:10:47.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,将军,不用担心她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.11,0:10:49.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,海伦·蕾普莉死于致力消灭异形
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.90,0:10:52.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,她差不多取得了成功
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:54.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想她重操旧业
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.87,0:10:57.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不会的  - 我们不会告诉她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.41,0:11:00.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就能安心了?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:04.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,身份核对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.63,0:11:10.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,请再试一次
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.63,0:11:12.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,裴瑞将军
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.05,0:11:16.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,若有异状
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.39,0:11:18.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,立刻消灭她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.39,0:11:20.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,对我而言,8号...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.77,0:11:24.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是一个副产品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.57,0:11:30.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,异形王后才值回票价
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.57,0:11:32.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 何时能产卵?  - 或者要几天
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.95,0:11:34.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,或许更快
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.91,0:11:39.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 急需那批货  - 我说过快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.62,0:12:19.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,叉子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:24.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 操  - 是叉子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:30.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们怎么...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.63,0:12:34.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么...制造你?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:36.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:43.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,不简单,我们取得...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.81,0:12:45.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰上冰冻血样本
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:48.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,你命丧的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.31,0:12:51.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,再造你,复制你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.25,0:12:54.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,佛奥十六号
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:12:58.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是太美妙吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:13:01.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,想起任何事吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:06.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 它长大了?  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.19,0:13:09.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,它长得很快
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.19,0:13:11.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,是王后
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:16.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.32,0:13:19.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,她会产卵,你们会死
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:23.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,机构所有的人都会死
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.49,0:13:25.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,机构?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:29.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,伟伦优达尼公司,蕾普莉8号生前的雇主
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.87,0:13:33.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,负责人类发展的联合企业...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.13,0:13:35.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,与军方签了合约
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:38.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,几十年前就没落了,那是好久以前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.01,0:13:40.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,被威名百货合并收购了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.93,0:13:45.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,战争的收获
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.31,0:13:48.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你将会发现...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:52.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,时代不同了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:54.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我怀疑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.65,0:13:56.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是盲目行动
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.65,0:14:00.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是军队,不是贪婪的机构
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:04.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,没什么分别
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.79,0:14:08.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们还是会死
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.92,0:14:12.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:20.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望你明白我们的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.51,0:14:24.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,想想看由它来镇压暴动
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.35,0:14:26.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,或研发出特殊金属与疫苗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:29.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,前所未见
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:31.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你该感到光荣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:35.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.73,0:14:38.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,那种生物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:40.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:44.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,训练后,它的潜力将无可限量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:49.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,翻身、装死
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:51.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.54,0:14:54.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不能教它杂耍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:58.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,为何不能?我们教你了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:13.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,(贝蒂商用货机 组员6名 未注册)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.35,0:15:17.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,小子,我告诉你密码
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:21.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,是EATME(吃我)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.49,0:15:23.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,请重复
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.82,0:15:25.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,坏家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:27.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:30.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,每次见到这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:34.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,女人像这样被绑在椅子上...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:38.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:41.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,请准备降落
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.13,0:15:44.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 保持平衡  - 已经就绪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.26,0:15:46.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,乖女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:49.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,想要什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:53.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,来杯咖啡怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:55.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,还要喝点什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:58.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,加点牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.19,0:16:03.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,到六百公尺再停
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.28,0:16:05.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,吓吓他们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞斯,柯儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:09.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,可恶,我们会死掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:29.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,(消磁)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:36.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 柯儿?  - 什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.98,0:16:41.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么东西有两只拇指,一只眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.82,0:16:44.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,红舌头...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:48.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,还会扮鬼脸的?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:51.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:02.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,两只拇指、一只眼睛、红舌头...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:06.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,还会扮鬼脸的?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.38,0:17:09.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.82,0:17:28.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,是时候享受将军的热情款待
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.53,0:17:31.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了,军队食物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.74,0:17:35.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,待武装登舰就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.75,0:17:39.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,若他们够友善的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:42.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,情况如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:44.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:46.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,会有麻烦吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:50.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,裴瑞将军?不会,但说不定,以前已尝试事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.78,0:18:08.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.82,0:18:10.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,练习射靶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.16,0:18:14.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞斯没投诉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:17.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,可恶!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.87,0:18:21.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,强纳,混蛋!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.08,0:18:24.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,行了!你根本没感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:31.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这狗娘养的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:39.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,刀给我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:48.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.07,0:18:52.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,他已经喝多了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.28,0:18:55.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,刀给我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:01.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,臭婆娘!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.50,0:19:07.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,别惹我,相处一段时间后
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.09,0:19:09.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会知道我是不好惹!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.77,0:19:23.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要和这种低级人一般见识
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.86,0:20:12.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是"父亲"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.03,0:20:15.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎登上奥瑞戈舰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.03,0:20:19.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,上前通过违禁品检查
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.78,0:20:22.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,若有传染病...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.87,0:20:24.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,请向医务官报告
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.87,0:20:28.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,7到12层,平民勿入
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:31.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢合作
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:33.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.72,0:20:38.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 举起手  - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.97,0:20:41.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,举起手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.23,0:20:53.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,不准携械登舰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.28,0:20:57.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,独家调配烈酒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:21:00.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,这更危险
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.75,0:21:08.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,这么热情欢迎,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.08,0:21:11.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,担心我们六个人劫舰?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:15.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是要肯定你们组员之中...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:17.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会因喝醉乱开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.97,0:21:20.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在太空中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:22.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没错  - 你好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.02,0:21:33.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,要检查椅子吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.03,0:21:42.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾金,这是千载难逢的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.53,0:21:44.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,这批货也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:49.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不是向我喊穷吧?  - 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:52.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,但近来很少用现金交易
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.46,0:21:55.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为有人不想留下纪录
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.17,0:21:57.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你也一样  - 有喝酒吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:21:59.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,常喝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.26,0:22:07.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我猜猜看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.14,0:22:10.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们进行的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:14.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,未经国会认可
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.07,0:22:18.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.49,0:22:21.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,新来的组员是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.20,0:22:25.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯儿,海盗学徙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:27.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,她美丽动人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.91,0:22:31.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,令人蠢蠢"欲"动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.67,0:22:42.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是灵活妙手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:46.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞斯看着她的眼神,好像很着迷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:49.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,那种尤物令跛子也会走路,明白没有?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:57.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,提醒你,她对我们的交易...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.53,0:23:00.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.32,0:23:02.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,不能怪她
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.32,0:23:04.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,太神秘了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.82,0:23:07.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,军事运作
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.45,0:23:10.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是吗?  - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.62,0:23:13.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我若说错请纠正
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.62,0:23:15.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,据我所知
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.84,0:23:20.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,一般军医实验不会在监查范围外运作的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:23.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你到底想怎么样?  - 我?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.72,0:23:27.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是的  - 两天的食宿
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.22,0:23:30.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞斯可能会偷点医药用品
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.35,0:23:32.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,若你不介意的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.39,0:23:34.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,就当在家一样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.27,0:23:37.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是有几个条件
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.27,0:23:38.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,条件?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.24,0:23:43.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你自己...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.49,0:23:45.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,与那批...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.49,0:23:47.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,勇猛组员...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.74,0:23:49.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,都不可接近...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.70,0:23:52.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,禁区
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.08,0:23:54.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,第二点:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.88,0:23:57.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,别惹麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.96,0:24:00.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 循规蹈矩  - 循规蹈矩
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.42,0:24:05.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不准打架  - 不准打架
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.51,0:24:10.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,其他没了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.46,0:24:39.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,请将货柜送入实验中心
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.96,0:24:43.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟随指示
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.38,0:24:45.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,请勿越界
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.73,0:24:59.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,货柜状态: 稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.36,0:25:02.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,生命迹象稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.15,0:25:04.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,休眠中
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.08,0:25:21.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,实验中心,平民勿入
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.79,0:25:23.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.32,0:26:36.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 噢  - 嘿,丘尔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.95,0:26:40.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拜托  - 我不喜欢高大的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.33,0:26:43.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好吗?一对一?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.67,0:26:45.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,意下如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.43,0:26:53.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,球技不错
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.43,0:26:55.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.48,0:27:06.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.87,0:27:21.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,若不想打篮球,我们还能玩点别的室内运动
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.22,0:27:36.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,球给我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.65,0:27:50.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有新游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.57,0:27:51.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,中招!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.67,0:28:09.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉,蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.01,0:28:17.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,玩够了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.60,0:28:24.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.61,0:28:36.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,她很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.70,0:28:40.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,她不断令我们引以为荣
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.90,0:29:59.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,订购此收藏品的时间...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.74,0:30:01.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,只剩下1分钟30秒
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.74,0:30:05.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,天!这是什么?电池液?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.70,0:30:08.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,加了颜色会好看点
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.00,0:32:19.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,它学得很快
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.67,0:32:22.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,这节目很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.92,0:32:25.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,来自科特公司...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.80,0:32:28.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,刀具和刃具的主要生产者
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.85,0:32:31.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,其生产的刀具很锋利
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.77,0:32:35.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,打猎、切菜,样样行
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.19,0:32:39.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,刀柄是用高级木材制作的...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.19,0:32:41.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,不掉色,又好看
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.86,0:32:45.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿!这些酒得来不易!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.53,0:32:47.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我滚出去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.78,0:32:50.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,...几乎能切开任何东西
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.98,0:32:54.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,岂有此理!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.45,0:32:56.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 很抱歉  - 弄得我混身臭味!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.08,0:32:59.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是不会喝
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.08,0:33:01.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,就别逞强!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.09,0:33:03.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,上床,贱人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.57,0:33:29.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,身份核对
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.37,0:33:42.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,请再试一次
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.75,0:33:48.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,裴瑞将军,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.67,0:34:25.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.26,0:34:30.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要杀我吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.93,0:34:34.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,没理由杀你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.93,0:34:37.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,异形生下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.47,0:34:40.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,哪里?在船上吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.35,0:34:44.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你指我的孩子?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.44,0:34:48.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不明白,他们取出异形
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.82,0:34:51.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,为何不杀你?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.53,0:34:55.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们很好奇,我是新实验
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.00,0:35:06.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,看...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.46,0:35:08.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能阻止一切
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.46,0:35:12.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,解除你的痛苦与噩梦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.48,0:35:22.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,何以见得...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.64,0:35:24.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会让你这么做?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.86,0:35:30.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.86,0:35:34.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,海伦·蕾普莉,一级中尉
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.03,0:35:37.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,编号36706
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.08,0:35:42.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉两百年前就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.08,0:35:46.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是她
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.54,0:35:49.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是她
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.43,0:35:58.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.43,0:36:02.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是实验室的制成品,她们再造了你
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.56,0:36:05.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在还用你生下它
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.90,0:36:08.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是原来的我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.07,0:36:19.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能感觉到...它就在我眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.70,0:36:22.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,能听到它移动
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.08,0:36:30.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,趁还来得及你得帮我阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.88,0:36:35.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.88,0:36:38.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你阻止不了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.43,0:36:40.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,避免不了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.60,0:36:45.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,有我在,休想
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.81,0:36:49.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你无法活着离开
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.15,0:36:52.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.86,0:36:54.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.49,0:37:00.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能阻止它
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.12,0:37:09.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,快走!快离开!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.46,0:37:11.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们在找你
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.43,0:37:27.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这样做简直愚不可及
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.14,0:37:29.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她的朋友呢?  - 在餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.77,0:37:32.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,立刻找来,别作声
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.02,0:37:34.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.86,0:37:37.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们背叛我们
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.91,0:37:41.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,坐轮椅的呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.33,0:37:44.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,别碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.41,0:37:45.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,永远别碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.62,0:37:48.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,究竟什么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.21,0:37:50.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们替谁工作?  - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.29,0:37:53.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 此事与他们无关  - 什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.50,0:37:56.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道恐怖行动的刑罚吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.51,0:38:00.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们当中没有恐怖份子,什么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.43,0:38:04.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,不论你知情与否,你带恐怖分子上军舰
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.39,0:38:07.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认为你们都该死
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.27,0:38:11.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,明白吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.19,0:38:16.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.53,0:38:18.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.66,0:38:22.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,克里斯蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.12,0:38:27.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,趴下!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.71,0:38:31.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,不准动!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.18,0:38:42.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,住手!丢下武器!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.59,0:38:46.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你!丢下武器!否则杀死他!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.51,0:38:48.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 做不到  - 立即抛下!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.02,0:38:51.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 做不到,他们隶属于我  - 我可不是说笑!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.69,0:38:54.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们全部因私藏枪械被捕
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.94,0:38:57.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有第十二号规例,谋杀罪!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.15,0:38:59.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 放开瑞温博士!  - 去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.15,0:39:01.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,放下你们的武器,保证...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.53,0:39:08.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.36,0:39:12.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,别紧张,阿兵哥
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.96,0:39:15.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 保安!  - 起来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.50,0:39:19.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,安全室餐厅发生严重暴动
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.17,0:39:21.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你敢骗我...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.93,0:39:26.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会割破你的喉咙,叫你死在这里,听到没?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.93,0:39:30.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是二号保安区  - 喂?妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.48,0:39:32.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,听不到,请再说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.60,0:39:34.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喂  - 请再说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.74,0:41:10.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰狄!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.78,0:41:14.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,他进行非法实验,他繁殖...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.50,0:41:18.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 杀了她!  - 听我说!他在培育异形
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.71,0:41:20.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们极之危险,若让异形逃脱...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.75,0:41:23.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,到时等于人类末日,最后大家同归于尽
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.55,0:41:26.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.01,0:41:28.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.01,0:41:32.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.56,0:41:36.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,紧急情况,在第15层实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.95,0:42:34.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,快回贝蒂号,出口没人看守
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.49,0:42:36.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 瑞斯怎么办?  - 有空管他
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.96,0:42:49.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.05,0:42:53.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,擅自闯入3号门
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.43,0:42:57.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,擅自闯入5号门
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.22,0:43:00.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,7号、8号、10号门
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.48,0:43:02.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快走!  - 撤离!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.85,0:43:05.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 走!  - 撤离!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.95,0:43:18.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.75,0:43:30.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 撤离!  - 快上去!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.34,0:43:33.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.30,0:43:34.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,侦测到非人类生物
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.01,0:43:38.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,在第21层、23层
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.85,0:43:42.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,27层、14层
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.02,0:43:47.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,38层、39层
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.82,0:43:50.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,撤离!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.57,0:43:53.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,登上救生船
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.70,0:43:55.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.82,0:43:57.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢合作
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.23,0:45:08.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀死你!恶心的混蛋!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.03,0:45:14.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,走!快!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.36,0:45:16.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 救生船准备起飞  - 上船!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.54,0:45:24.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,走!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.54,0:45:27.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,立即撤离
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.17,0:45:37.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,手榴弹
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.85,0:46:34.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,警报!警报!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.19,0:46:36.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,未完全撤离
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.32,0:46:41.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,H区发现尚有平民,警告
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.70,0:46:45.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,船舰不适合人类驻留
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.25,0:46:55.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾金,来,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.25,0:46:57.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.00,0:48:20.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾金?艾金,你在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.56,0:48:31.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾金,你在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.10,0:48:37.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾金
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.64,0:49:16.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾金
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.73,0:49:19.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 天哪,艾金?  - 艾金?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.86,0:49:22.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾金
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.36,0:49:25.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾金
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.15,0:49:27.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,小小,哈立德!克里斯蒂,帮我一把!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.86,0:49:29.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 扶起他!  - 帮我一把!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.57,0:49:33.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快!扶起他!  - 滚开!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.16,0:49:35.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不!  - 噢,惨了!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.16,0:49:37.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是什么弄的?  - 什么鬼东西?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.05,0:49:46.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 趴下  - 那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.34,0:49:48.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,别开枪,会射到船身
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.35,0:49:52.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.93,0:49:56.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快离开!  - 回来!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.64,0:49:59.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,去死!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.60,0:50:02.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯儿!走了!快点!柯儿!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.90,0:50:06.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,快打开门!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.57,0:50:10.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,打不开!打不开门!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.24,0:50:18.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 得回头去!  - 我不去!你去!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.52,0:50:47.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,他妈的什么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.90,0:50:49.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,如你所愿?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.36,0:50:54.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,别碰他
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.67,0:51:06.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.46,0:51:10.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 老样子,离开这鬼地方!  - 假如还有异形呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.09,0:51:15.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,留在这里,让军人处理
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.72,0:51:17.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,军人在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.89,0:51:20.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.31,0:51:22.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不需要他了!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.35,0:51:24.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 退后!  - 不,你退后!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.36,0:51:26.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别吵!  - 轮不到你指挥!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.82,0:51:32.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,博士,杀我同伴那东西...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.66,0:51:36.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就是你的实验品?  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.24,0:51:39.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我杀了他!  - 应该让他杀了你!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.66,0:51:42.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有多少异形?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.33,0:51:45.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 究竟还有多少只?  - 12只
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.67,0:51:52.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 十二只?  - 十二只
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.39,0:51:56.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,十二只
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.72,0:51:58.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,还会有更多
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.39,0:52:02.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.20,0:52:05.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要跟谁干才能离开这里?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.00,0:52:11.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来,不一定能离开,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.13,0:52:16.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快走  - 不 且慢!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.30,0:52:18.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,她是这些异形的宿主
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.38,0:52:20.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,她体内有异形,所以瑞温复制她
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.88,0:52:23.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,她不是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.51,0:52:27.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,她也是实验品,随时翻脸不认人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.60,0:52:29.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不管她是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.60,0:52:32.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,太冒险了,不能带她走
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.40,0:52:35.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 带她走  - 我们不能相信她!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.82,0:52:37.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我谁也不信
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.53,0:52:44.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,想活命就要团结一致
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.74,0:52:46.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,同意吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.67,0:53:01.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈立德,我们走,事情还没完结,我们要回贝蒂号去
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.91,0:53:33.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,不错的纪念品
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.34,0:53:43.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,没想到你会那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.01,0:53:46.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 做什么?  - 杀死异形
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.51,0:53:49.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 杀你的同类  - 它阻我去路
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.33,0:54:15.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.38,0:54:22.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以为是谁?圣诞老人?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.42,0:54:25.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为你死了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.43,0:54:28.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾金在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.72,0:54:33.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.73,0:54:36.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,若异形都在贝蒂号上呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.44,0:54:39.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有活动都在舰尾的兵营发生,它们为何要转移阵地?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.06,0:54:39.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.94,0:54:41.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,假如异形出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.94,0:54:44.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,会来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.36,0:54:47.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人肉的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.61,0:54:51.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,为节省时间,该甩了那跛子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.75,0:54:57.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 恕我直言  - 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.42,0:55:00.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,不可以丢下任何人,包括你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.75,0:55:05.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哪条路是捷径?  - 冷却塔后
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.59,0:55:07.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,有运货电梯
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.26,0:55:10.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,由舰顶直通舰底
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.76,0:55:14.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 直达码头  - 很好,就这么办
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.27,0:55:17.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,船在移动
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.77,0:55:20.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 船在移动
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.86,0:55:22.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感觉得到
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.65,0:55:26.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,船是超静动力,你不可能感到移动
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.20,0:55:29.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,她说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.24,0:55:32.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,异形攻击后船就动了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.12,0:55:35.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是标准紧急程序  - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.20,0:55:38.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,遇上任何危机,船就自动回航
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.71,0:55:40.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你打算何时才告诉我们?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.04,0:55:42.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,没人问我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.88,0:55:46.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,基地在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.72,0:55:49.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,地球
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.68,0:55:52.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,惨了!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.14,0:55:55.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 混蛋!  - 地球?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.10,0:55:57.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我宁可被它吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.14,0:55:59.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,多久到达地球?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.44,0:56:01.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,大概3小时
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.23,0:56:03.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,必须炸了船
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.44,0:56:06.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯儿,不能炸掉船
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.28,0:56:08.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,除非离船之后
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.74,0:56:12.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,离开后随便你炸
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.24,0:56:17.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,地球是个烂地方
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.92,0:56:27.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有异样
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.05,0:56:36.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.81,0:56:43.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,听说...你跟异形交手过
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.44,0:56:47.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没错  - 厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.94,0:56:51.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,那当时你怎样做?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.20,0:56:56.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我死了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.48,0:57:24.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,走错路了!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.94,0:57:30.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.53,0:57:39.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉,快走!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.96,0:57:45.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉,没时间观光
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.26,0:57:52.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.38,0:59:57.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀了...我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.27,1:00:10.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀了我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.87,1:01:53.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要,蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.88,1:02:04.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.10,1:02:18.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样做何苦呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.82,1:02:20.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,浪费弹药
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.98,1:02:22.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,走!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.78,1:02:26.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,女人才会这样
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.46,1:03:39.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我在做梦吗?这是我们带来的货?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.05,1:03:42.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,就是他们
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.56,1:03:46.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,臭死了!走吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.76,1:04:22.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,离我远一点!离我远一点!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.64,1:04:24.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 抛下棍子  - 离我远一点!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.64,1:04:27.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 抛下!  - 离我远一点!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.22,1:04:31.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,离我远一点!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.15,1:04:35.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.36,1:04:38.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事?  - 冷静点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.57,1:04:42.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须离开这个鬼船
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.57,1:04:45.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么船?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.12,1:04:49.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.66,1:04:53.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在冰温舱,去撒伦星,对吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.29,1:04:55.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是铸币工人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.92,1:04:58.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我醒来,我不明白...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.63,1:05:05.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊,我看到可怕的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.55,1:05:09.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我们走,这里太危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.24,1:05:21.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,留下他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.74,1:05:24.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,去你的!不能留下他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.62,1:05:28.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,他体内有异形
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.58,1:05:30.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我闻得出来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.96,1:05:34.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,在我体内?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.04,1:05:39.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我体内有什么?  - 天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.50,1:05:42.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想有异形出生
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.13,1:05:43.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,太冒险了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.84,1:05:48.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我体内有什么?  - 不能留下他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.68,1:05:51.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不希望它们繁殖吧?  - 我体内有什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.14,1:05:54.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一定有办法!能阻止吗?  - 没时间
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.35,1:05:57.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 无法在这里做  - 我体内有什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.11,1:05:59.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以向他后脑开一枪
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.36,1:06:01.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会痛,这样最好
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.82,1:06:04.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我体内有什么?  - 不要这样,一定有其他办法
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.45,1:06:07.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 冷藏他?  - 我体内到底有什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.74,1:06:08.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,寄生虫!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.29,1:06:13.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,有个外来生物
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.88,1:06:21.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你胸部有个怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.46,1:06:25.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们夺走你的船
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.51,1:06:27.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,把冰温舱卖给...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.55,1:06:30.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.51,1:06:33.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,他将异形植入你体内
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.93,1:06:35.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,很恶心的那种
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.90,1:06:40.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,几小时后...它会穿破你胸膛...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.07,1:06:43.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会死去
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.07,1:06:50.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有问题吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.00,1:06:59.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.71,1:07:03.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是怪物的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.34,1:07:09.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着,他跟我们走,我们将他冷藏在船上...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.11,1:07:12.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 稍后再让医生把异形弄掉  - 这下好了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.57,1:07:14.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你几时变成指挥官?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.99,1:07:18.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 从你变成胆小鬼开始  - 不要吵了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.54,1:07:31.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,你也来,可能有机会活着
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.46,1:07:34.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是你敢妄动,就必死无疑
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.62,1:07:37.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.47,1:07:51.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,一塌糊涂!只有这条路?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.55,1:07:54.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞斯,你不能再坐轮椅了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.77,1:07:58.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.81,1:08:00.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我背你过去,好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.02,1:08:04.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对,就和以前一样  - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.01,1:08:09.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定是冷却槽
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.53,1:08:14.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人开了水阀
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.20,1:08:16.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会是异形吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.80,1:08:31.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在船底
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.43,1:08:34.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,要经过厨房,约90尺
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.64,1:08:37.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,到另一端的货运电梯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.64,1:08:41.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不喜欢  - 谁管你?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.31,1:08:44.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,糟透了!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.02,1:08:48.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你确定距离?  - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.03,1:08:52.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 准备好浸湿了吗?同伴?  - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.50,1:09:04.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,武器浸过水没问题吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.04,1:09:09.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是即弃型武器,没问题  - 即弃型?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.43,1:09:15.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听过这种武器
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.51,1:09:20.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有几发子弹?  - 20发
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.02,1:09:24.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,口径虽小,火力可不小
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.65,1:09:27.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.82,1:09:31.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀手最喜欢用的,杀光了就可以丢掉
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.36,1:09:34.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,连在身上的武器,我可抛不掉
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.87,1:09:36.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,懂
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.62,1:09:39.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,不说也知道,要深深吸口气吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.88,1:09:47.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,克里斯蒂,帮帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.89,1:09:50.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,当我们游到对岸时...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.89,1:09:53.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,别用仰泳,知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.92,1:13:27.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,天!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.95,1:13:42.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们设了陷阱
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.00,1:13:44.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,有埋伏!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.98,1:14:51.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,上去!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.25,1:15:15.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,打不开,枪给我
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.76,1:15:19.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,你太信任别人了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.28,1:15:33.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.07,1:15:44.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你杀了她!混蛋!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.00,1:15:51.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,去死!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.71,1:15:54.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,"父亲",锁上门
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.85,1:16:13.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,克里斯蒂!快爬!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.52,1:16:15.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我在爬!  - 加油!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.15,1:16:17.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,加把劲!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.48,1:16:20.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 卡住了!  - 快爬!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.36,1:16:23.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡住了!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.15,1:16:57.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,放开我的脚,贱人!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.66,1:17:07.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,放开我!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.37,1:17:12.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,强纳!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.29,1:17:14.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,放开我!放开我!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.50,1:17:18.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,啊!强纳!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.76,1:17:23.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,死吧!混蛋!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.88,1:17:28.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀死它!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.64,1:17:31.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.82,1:17:47.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,很刺激吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.31,1:18:19.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,克里斯蒂!克里斯蒂!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.44,1:18:23.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,克里斯蒂!不!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.40,1:18:27.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,克里斯蒂!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.86,1:18:31.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你干什么?别这么做!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.45,1:18:34.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,不!我们会成功的!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.83,1:18:37.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.75,1:18:42.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.47,1:19:32.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.27,1:19:37.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.81,1:19:44.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,孩子,真高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.52,1:19:47.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,那混蛋打中你一枪,受伤了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.53,1:19:49.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.78,1:19:53.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你穿了防弹衣?  - 对,走!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.24,1:19:55.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看到你胸部中弹
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.85,1:20:19.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是机器人?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.93,1:20:24.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,贱货!真令人惊讶!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.69,1:20:28.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我早该料到没这么完美的人类
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.90,1:20:31.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,和机械人讲逻辑
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.49,1:20:34.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你却像疯子
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.16,1:20:37.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是机器人?  - 第二代机器人?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.68,1:20:40.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥谭型机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.02,1:20:45.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,机器人造的机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.35,1:20:47.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,对了,我想起来了!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.48,1:20:50.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,本来预期复兴合成人工业
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.28,1:20:52.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,后来却全毁了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.28,1:20:55.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们不听命行事
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.95,1:20:58.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,被政府收回
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.28,1:21:00.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,听说...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.62,1:21:03.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有很少数流入市面
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.62,1:21:06.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没料到能亲眼见到!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.88,1:21:11.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了,她是烤面包机
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.21,1:21:13.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以走了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.61,1:21:17.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,多久到达地球?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.18,1:21:20.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不到两小时  - 瑞斯
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.22,1:21:22.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,有螺帽吗?或者她只需换油?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.47,1:21:26.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对不起,不准进入  - 我差点与她做了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.40,1:21:28.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你又不是没毁过机器人!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.27,1:21:31.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道,如果瑞温接上电脑,我们就完了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.86,1:21:34.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 必须找到终端机  - 这里没操控台
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.86,1:21:37.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 必须回头  - 不能回头
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.41,1:21:40.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不知温的密码  - 帮我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.08,1:21:44.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯儿?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.79,1:21:46.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不行
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.96,1:21:49.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是新机型
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.29,1:21:52.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 能遥控操作主机  - 不行
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.96,1:21:55.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我烧了数据机
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.55,1:21:59.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯儿,你还是能转回人手操作,你懂得的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.34,1:22:03.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,上面有个电脑接口
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.73,1:22:06.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯儿
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.82,1:22:15.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你的程式是这么设计的  - 别逼我
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.36,1:22:17.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,别让我逼你
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.20,1:22:21.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想进入
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.12,1:22:23.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感觉好虚幻,不是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.99,1:22:26.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,克服它
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.21,1:22:28.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,到达地球之前将船炸毁...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.37,1:22:30.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀光它们
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.72,1:22:43.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我们时间逃出
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.10,1:22:48.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 可恶  - 有资料吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.69,1:22:50.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.82,1:22:57.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,7区、3区受损
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.11,1:23:01.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,9区不稳定
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.24,1:23:05.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,引擎运转指数41%
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.16,1:23:08.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,86分钟后抵达地球
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.25,1:23:10.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,船的能源受损
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.71,1:23:14.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,无法将船炸掉
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.09,1:23:16.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就撞毁它
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.06,1:23:32.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.36,1:23:36.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.44,1:23:38.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很好
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.94,1:23:42.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,重新调整底层
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.24,1:23:45.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,新目的地7-6-0-4-0-3
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.83,1:23:48.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,朝无人之地飞行
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.37,1:23:51.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,自动减速系统关闭,减速增快
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.67,1:23:57.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,距离撞毁还有43分8秒
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.80,1:24:01.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,清空往贝蒂号的路...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.43,1:24:04.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,启动贝蒂号
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.34,1:24:06.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.75,1:24:35.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,请稍候
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.22,1:24:44.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,45操控台输入新指令
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.47,1:24:51.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞温在搞鬼,他就快到达贝蒂号了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.15,1:25:07.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,父亲,回复电力,请回答
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.99,1:25:13.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,父亲!父亲!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.50,1:25:21.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,父亲死了,混蛋!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.34,1:25:26.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,第一层有入侵者
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.34,1:25:30.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,异形请到第一层集合
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.47,1:25:32.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真够狠毒
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.23,1:25:39.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 可恶!  - 让我看看
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.94,1:25:42.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别碰我  - 别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.90,1:25:46.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一定觉得很有趣
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.66,1:25:50.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,最近发现很多有趣事
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.78,1:25:52.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我觉得并非真的有趣
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.96,1:26:02.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为何要活下去?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.38,1:26:07.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能接受这个事实吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.18,1:26:11.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没有选择余地
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.43,1:26:17.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,至少你有一部份是人
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.94,1:26:22.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我只是...  - 看看我
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.32,1:26:25.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,真恶心
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.28,1:26:29.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为何来此?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.78,1:26:31.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,来杀你,记得吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.95,1:26:34.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,被收回前
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.33,1:26:36.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我进入主机
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.33,1:26:40.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,政府所有最机密下流的秘密行动都在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.75,1:26:44.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,有你、异形
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.55,1:26:48.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,和贝蒂号的组员,计划成功,人类势必灭亡
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.63,1:26:51.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,与你何干?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.85,1:26:54.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我被程式控制
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.77,1:26:57.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你被设定成混蛋?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.85,1:27:02.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是新上市的混蛋机型?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.15,1:27:03.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,帮帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.78,1:27:08.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,这种事我看不下去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.53,1:27:11.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,不能让人类自我灭绝
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.70,1:27:13.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你明白吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.54,1:27:19.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,本来明白
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.54,1:27:22.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我试图救人
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.29,1:27:25.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是没有用
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.05,1:27:28.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,有个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.88,1:27:32.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,她会发恶梦
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.05,1:27:36.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想救她
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.22,1:27:39.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,她死了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.35,1:27:42.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我记不起她的名字了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.82,1:27:49.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,快到了吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.82,1:27:51.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.03,1:27:55.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会发梦吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.12,1:27:59.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有神经系统
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.75,1:28:03.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我发梦就会梦到异形
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.25,1:28:07.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,每个晚上,到处都是,也在我体内
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.63,1:28:10.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,本来我怕发梦,现在不怕了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.05,1:28:13.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.72,1:28:15.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为每当我发了恶梦
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.80,1:28:17.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,醒来见到的比梦境更可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.40,1:28:25.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 离贝蒂号不远了!  - 天啊,我累死了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.73,1:28:27.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,死后可睡个够
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.24,1:28:41.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,糟!情况不妙!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.54,1:28:45.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 接近异形巢穴了  - 我们走别条路
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.54,1:28:48.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没时间了  - 还有90分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.72,1:28:50.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不是了  - 什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.85,1:28:54.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你做了什么?  - 走了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.89,1:28:59.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想跟其他的人死在这里,随便你!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.31,1:29:01.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我还想活!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.82,1:29:04.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,这机器人敢耍花样...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.40,1:29:06.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就杀死她!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.45,1:29:10.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀死你!理解没有?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.66,1:29:12.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,要我画图表给你吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.87,1:29:15.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.00,1:29:21.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,还要纪念品?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.01,1:29:30.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 离码头有多远?  - 100码
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.02,1:29:46.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.32,1:29:49.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.61,1:29:51.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉,我们要走了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.49,1:29:55.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听到它们
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.58,1:29:58.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听到它们,它们离我们很近
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.37,1:30:00.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 蕾普莉  - 是王后
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.33,1:30:03.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,它很痛苦
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.34,1:30:07.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.09,1:30:11.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.43,1:30:13.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.91,1:30:36.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.42,1:30:51.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要走了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.43,1:30:55.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,只能祈祷她死得快些
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.10,1:30:57.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.93,1:30:59.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样不对
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.93,1:31:02.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我见惯不怪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.49,1:32:01.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯儿 全靠你了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.57,1:32:04.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,再接上电脑,打开舱门
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.59,1:32:18.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,把他放入冰温舱中
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.51,1:32:20.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.76,1:32:24.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,小睡片刻
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.94,1:32:33.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,别动,否则轰了...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.15,1:32:35.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,她脑袋
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.51,1:32:38.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,达斯,拿掉他们的枪
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.39,1:32:40.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起,长官,但是去你的!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.85,1:32:44.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我杀死她,你杀死我
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.68,1:32:47.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家都要死,别想回家!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.77,1:32:50.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,丢下武器
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.86,1:32:57.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,让机器人...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.11,1:32:59.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,接上奥瑞戈号
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.53,1:33:01.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,带我们回基地去
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.91,1:33:04.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,就按标准程序去做
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.45,1:33:07.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,休想  - 你疯了?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.79,1:33:09.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,还想将异形带回地球?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.92,1:33:13.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你到现在还不明白?  - 智者说话了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.30,1:33:16.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别动  - 听着,如果你不...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.17,1:33:18.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你闭嘴行不?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.52,1:33:33.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,为啥没人听我的话?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.73,1:34:19.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说了,开始很正常...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.82,1:34:22.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,王后产卵,突然变了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.95,1:34:25.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有另一个巢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.87,1:34:30.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.04,1:34:38.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在不需宿主了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.51,1:34:41.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,不产卵了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.09,1:34:44.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,只需要她的子宫...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.89,1:34:47.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,孕育怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.77,1:34:50.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉给她的礼物:
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.73,1:34:54.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,人类再生系统
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.56,1:34:57.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为你的缘故...蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.94,1:35:01.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,它已臻完美!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.41,1:36:30.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.83,1:36:33.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,美丽的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.84,1:36:36.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,美丽的蝴蝶
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.66,1:37:06.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.83,1:37:12.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,不!不!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.01,1:38:09.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.68,1:38:13.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,美丽的小宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.60,1:38:18.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,它当你是母亲
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.82,1:38:23.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.40,1:38:25.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.95,1:38:33.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,对!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.37,1:38:37.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,来!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.73,1:38:56.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,民用太空船连线
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.10,1:38:58.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,批准紧急撤退
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.24,1:39:06.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,太热了,要打开气密门,缩回夹钳
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.86,1:39:09.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,我得找到...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.62,1:39:12.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,垂直推进器
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.58,1:39:20.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们会驾驶吗?  - 会!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.89,1:39:38.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 准备发射  - 不!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.02,1:39:41.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.93,1:40:12.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿  - 我以为你死了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.76,1:40:16.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听惯了这句,怎么还没走?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.43,1:40:21.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在设法用人手操作
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.36,1:40:23.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 天啊!  - 嘿,蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.44,1:40:25.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我记性好,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.82,1:40:27.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 蕾普莉回来了  - 是那个吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.02,1:40:29.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.61,1:40:31.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会驾驶这艘船吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.87,1:40:34.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,开玩笑,它比我还老
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.08,1:40:38.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,糟糕,舱门没关
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.62,1:40:42.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我关了  - 舱门每次都出问题!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.25,1:40:44.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去处理
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.65,1:41:08.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,接近地球大气层
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.57,1:41:12.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,安全驶离时间还剩46秒
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.41,1:41:17.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯儿,我们要走了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.29,1:41:19.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯儿
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.42,1:41:24.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须离开
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.09,1:41:33.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,安全驶离时间还剩20秒
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.31,1:41:40.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓稳,我们要走了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.84,1:41:57.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.23,1:42:12.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,船身快裂了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.69,1:42:16.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,压力不稳!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.61,1:42:23.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,叫柯儿开启备用气泵!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.98,1:42:52.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,达斯?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.00,1:43:16.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,快啊!加速!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.75,1:43:19.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,我又不是机械师,勇士!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.55,1:43:21.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只会杀人!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.51,1:43:24.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,混蛋!柯儿!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.18,1:43:28.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯儿,快回来!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.14,1:43:32.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯儿!柯儿!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.64,1:43:37.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉!嘿!蕾普莉!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.11,1:43:44.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,强纳,你在哪?你这婊子养的?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.65,1:43:47.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快过来!混蛋!  - 我该怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.99,1:43:49.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧控制杆
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.63,1:44:05.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,放下她!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.06,1:45:45.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.08,1:46:07.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.13,1:46:09.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.30,1:46:14.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.31,1:46:20.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.83,1:46:48.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥瑞戈号5秒后撞毁
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.13,1:46:51.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,四秒、三秒
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.34,1:46:53.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,二秒、一秒
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.84,1:46:54.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.79,1:47:21.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么东西起火了?  - 是我们!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.58,1:47:28.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的!你说对了!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.29,1:48:49.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是地球?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.58,1:48:53.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是地球
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.13,1:48:59.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我第一次来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.47,1:49:07.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,军队很快就会找到我们
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.93,1:49:10.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好像很失望
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.93,1:49:12.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,的确是
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.90,1:49:16.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这种地方很容易迷路
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.15,1:49:21.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得如何?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.82,1:49:23.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们该怎办?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.32,1:49:27.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.62,1:49:30.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也是第一次来这里
